    steps: ["On Candidates we take your subject's entries in the year (GCSE: all qualifications in the subject; Post-16: the one qualification).", "We add up the entries of every subject in the comparison group, your subject included (at Post-16 every qualification except AS and AEA).", "Your subject's share is its entries divided by the group's total.", "On Grade bands the donut is the whole group instead: graded entries inside your chosen range as a share of all the group's graded entries, counting only qualifications on the range's grade scale."],
